# Part F5 of the lab: the end-to-end test of POST /api/insurligent/preauth/info.
# Open this file in VS Code with the REST Client extension (humao.rest-client).
# Click "Send Request" above a request. The reply opens on the right.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:52773/api/insurligent
@user = _SYSTEM
@password = SYS

### 1. A known patient: HTTP 200, with the patient and the insurer
POST {{baseUrl}}/preauth/info
Authorization: Basic {{user}}:{{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "search_type": "CID",
  "identity_no": "3-1258-00558-89-8",
  "hospital_code": "RAMA9"
}

### 2. A passport search: HTTP 400, because search_type must be CID
POST {{baseUrl}}/preauth/info
Authorization: Basic {{user}}:{{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "search_type": "PID",
  "identity_no": "3-1258-00558-89-8",
  "hospital_code": "RAMA9"
}

### 3. A missing field: HTTP 400, because identity_no is required
POST {{baseUrl}}/preauth/info
Authorization: Basic {{user}}:{{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "search_type": "CID",
  "hospital_code": "RAMA9"
}

### 4. An unknown patient: HTTP 200, with "response_code":"404" in the body
POST {{baseUrl}}/preauth/info
Authorization: Basic {{user}}:{{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "search_type": "CID",
  "identity_no": "9999999999999",
  "hospital_code": "RAMA9"
}
